ive spoken ABABA turns; under 75 words.\",\n      \"reservation\": \"A3 can embarrass B, but A should sincerely regard the memory as a warm introduction.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"exampleId\": \"S55-single-b\",\n      \"beforeHash\": \"b0c807dc847fea032f5fbdd6db489c4f71bf86d3a98c166805bee20c09c7de56\",\n      \"firstPass\": {\n        \"ratings\": {\n          \"cardFidelity\": {\n            \"score\": 5,\n            \"evidence\": \"A1 invokes the first day, A3 recalls shared confusion, and A5 directly refuses the distance implied by B's managerial rank.\"\n          },\n          \"responseLogic\": {\n            \"score\": 4,\n            \"evidence\": \"A3 answers B2's management boundary with shared beginnings; A5 answers B4's managerial claim with another appeal to those beginnings.\"\n          },\n          \"relationship\": {\n            \"score\": 3,\n            \"evidence\": \"B2 and B4 repeat the same rank boundary without introducing a practical reason or changed option.\"\n          },\n          \"heightening\": {\n            \"score\": 3,\n            \"evidence\": \"A5's demand to remember repeats A3's tactic without developing the seating situation.\"\n          },\n          \"specificity\": {\n            \"score\": 4,\n            \"evidence\": \"A1's moved chair and A3's first-day search for toilets give actors concrete shared history.\"\n          },\n          \"brevityWit\": {\n            \"score\": 3,\n            \"evidence\": \"A5's 'manage to remember' foregrounds a wordplay rebuke more than a fresh action toward equality.\"\n          }\n        },\n        \"weightedTotal\": 78\n      },\n      \"beats\": [\n        {\n          \"speaker\": \"A\",\n          \"text\": \"I've pulled my chair beside yours for the induction. Like our first day.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"speaker\": \"B\",\n          \"text\": \"I'm introducing myself as their manager.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"speaker\": \"A\",\n          \"te